# Neuron needs no environment configuration.
# No database, no API key, no account. These are optional overrides only.

# Run against a different project directory than the current one.
# NEURON_CWD=/path/to/project

# Override how agents may write memory: manual | suggest | automatic
# (normally set during `neuron init` and stored in .neuron/prefs.json)
# NEURON_PRIVACY_MODE=suggest
